OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANo regular contact with pair held
OL,4,Ain Iran, family say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British couple who have been detained
OL,7,Fin Iran for more than 20 months have
OL,8,Fnot had regular contact restored with
OL,9,Ftheir family, despite assurances, their
OL,10,Ffamily say.
OL,12,FLindsay and Craig Foreman, who were
OL,13,Fsentenced to 10 years in jail over
OL,14,Fespionage charges which they deny, were
OL,15,Fpromised family contact after they
OL,16,Fended hunger strikes, but there had not
OL,17,Fbeen regular calls since, they said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
